/*
Host头攻击漏洞检测插件
用于检测广泛性的Host头攻击漏洞，只检测，不保证可利用性。
By Dp7.xyz
最新更新时间: 2025.12.31
*/

# 需过滤的文件拓展名和域名，可自行添加
outResourceExteensions = [".js", ".css", ".png", ".jpg", ".gif", ".pdf", ".ico", ".webp",".svg", ".jpeg", ".mp3", ".mp4", ".bmp", ".flv", ".acc", ".ogg", ".avi", ".woff", ".woff2", ".doc", ".docx", ".wps", ".ppt", ".pptx", "google.com", ".googleapis.com", "gstatic.com", "bdstatic.com", "weixinbridge.com", "qq.com", "qlogo.cn", "baidu.com", "qpic.cn", "dun.163.com"]
// 匹配需要过滤掉的域名与扩展名，尽量减少进入检测阶段的流量
isextFilter = func(origin){
    for ext in outResourceExteensions{
        if str.MatchAnyOfGlob(str.ToLower(origin), "*"+ext+"*"){
            return true
        }
    }
}

# 重复漏洞降噪，同域名之下每个漏洞只记录一个
ifvuln = func(origin, url){
    for vulns = range risk.QueryRisksByKeyword(origin){
        urlTohost = str.ExtractHost(url)
        if str.MatchAnyOfGlob(vulns, "*"+urlTohost+"*"){
            return true
        }
    }
}

// mirrorNewWebsite 会镜像过滤后的流量到这里，每个网站只会触发一次
mirrorNewWebsitePath = func(isHttps /*bool*/, url /*string*/, req /*[]byte*/, rsp /*[]byte*/, body /*[]byte*/) {
    StatusCode = poc.GetStatusCodeFromResponse(rsp)
    headers = poc.GetHTTPPacketHeaders(req)
    host_port = headers['Host']
    host = str.Split(host_port, ":")
    println("=Host头攻击检测开始=")

    if StatusCode >= 200 && StatusCode < 400 && !isextFilter(url) {
        attackHost = ""
        if len(host) > 1 {
            attackHost = string(host[0]) + ".attack.yak" + ":" + string(host[1])
        } else {
            attackHost = host[0] + ".attack.yak"
        }

        # 开始检测Host头攻击
        if ifvuln("Host_Attack", url) {
            println("[ ! ] Host头攻击漏洞已存在: ", url)
        } else {
            req = poc.ReplaceHTTPPacketHeader(req, "Host", attackHost)
            resRaw, reqRaw, err = poc.HTTP(req, poc.https(isHttps), poc.host(host[0]))
            if len(host) > 1 {
                resRaw, reqRaw, err = poc.HTTP(req, poc.https(isHttps), poc.host(host[0]), poc.port(int(host[1])))
            }
            if err != nil {
                println("请求失败:", url)
            }
            Scode = poc.GetStatusCodeFromResponse(resRaw)
            Shesder = poc.GetHTTPPacketHeader(resRaw, "Location")
            // println("Code: ", Scode)
            // println(string(resRaw))
            if Scode >= 200 && Scode < 400 && Shesder != "" &&  str.MatchAnyOfSubString(Shesder, attackHost) {
                // println("Location: ",Shesder)
                risk.NewRisk(url, 
                risk.title(sprintf("[ ! ] Host头攻击漏洞")),
                risk.severity("low"),
                risk.titleVerbose("Host头攻击漏洞"),
                risk.type("Host_Attack"),
                risk.description(sprintf(
                    "[ ! ] 检测到Host头攻击漏洞\n\n" + 
                    "漏洞详情:\n" + 
                    f"漏洞URL: ${url}\n" + 
                    "漏洞复现: 在 Web Fuzzer 模块的\"配置\"中，设置好真实Host后，将请求包中的Host头值更改，然后重发包\n\n" + 
                    "漏洞描述:\n" + 
                    "Host头攻击可能导致请求被错误路由或造成信息泄露，如服务器在处理重定向时，未正确验证Host头，攻击者可以控制重定向的目的地址。Host_Attack"
                    )),
                risk.solution(
                    "修复建议: 配置白名单，判断Host头是否正确。"
                    ),
                risk.payload(attackHost),
                risk.request(reqRaw),
                risk.response(resRaw)
                )
            }
        }
    }
}
